WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.840
If you take a blood thinner medication, you may need to adjust your timing

2
00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:05.360
before the procedure.

3
00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:09.460
Blood thinners can affect our ability to safely address anything we find during

4
00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:10.640
your colonoscopy,

5
00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:15.360
so getting the timing right matters. Please contact your doctor's office as

6
00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:16.240
soon as possible

7
00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:20.340
if you haven't already discussed this with them. Do not stop or change your

8
00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:21.200
blood thinner on

9
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:25.680
your own. They will give you specific instructions based on your medication and

10
00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:26.720
your personal health

11
00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:32.320
history. This is an important one so please don't wait on it.
